    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quizrealms: From Stone to Steam</strong> invites you into a world where knowledge reigns supreme and the spirit of the Victorian era breathes life into every corner of your adventure. Test your wits across a dazzling range of quiz modes, each richly themed and visually inspired by the grandeur, discovery, and curiosity of the 19th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>30,000 handcrafted questions</strong> spanning <strong>science</strong>, <strong>geography</strong>, <strong>pop culture</strong>, <strong>sports</strong>, and <strong>history</strong>, there's a challenge awaiting every kind of mind. Whether you\u2019re a scholar seeking glory, a traveler mapping the world, or a curious soul diving into forgotten lore, Quizrealms offers a journey tailored to your passions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Unique Game Modes:</strong> From a child-friendly &quot;Survival of the Smartest&quot; mode to intense competitive duels, each mode offers a distinct gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op and PvP:</strong> Team up with friends or face off in thrilling local multiplayer battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victorian Visual Flair:</strong> Each mode features unique art and gameplay designs inspired by the rich textures and spirit of the Victorian age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Question Bank:</strong> Over 30,000 questions ensure endless replayability and fresh challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements Galore:</strong> Unlock over <strong>30 in-game achievements</strong> and <strong>Steam achievements</strong> as you conquer modes and master your knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding Horizons:</strong> Plans to introduce online multiplayer are in place, based on player interest and community feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the grand halls of Quizrealms, where only the sharpest minds and quickest wits will triumph. Will you rise to the challenge?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/03e6d1fcb030fea2338ec3f6a2590ab9.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/94fef06d7823b401a60f58084857574d.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/0fac2b30b1d1363bd03e0c6667a1a4e7.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/37df5f0d65c266bd0fabf5fe950cf3b0.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/633d10e705c0578b08eecca6120e3b4a.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/0a0358aebb88caa26398ccfc5dd4723f.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/4a98e6c74e88545eaeabfed7d3f8c6f6.avif?t=1754827205\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707390/extras/a631a2ce3e46